  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/04/IMG_3211.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(27 fotos) Desde la medianoche del viernes al s&aacute;bado hasta bien entrada la madrugada, la banda de rock Dusting ha ofrecido un concierto extraordinario de versiones de los mejores temas de la historia en el pub Flamenkito de Onda,&nbsp;en la avenida Pa&iacute;s Valenci&agrave;, 110,&nbsp;esquina calle Alzira.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/04/IMG_3233.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>En uno delos temas ha colaborado la cantante Abisai Crusella.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertdustingflamenkito070417/img_3195.jpg\" alt=\"img_3195\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertdustingflamenkito070417/img_3197.jpg\" alt=\"img_3197\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertdustingflamenkito070417/img_3200.jpg\" alt=\"img_3200\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertdustingflamenkito070417/img_3202.jpg\" alt=\"img_3202\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertdustingflamenkito070417/img_3203.jpg\" alt=\"img_3203\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertdustingflamenkito070417/img_3204.jpg\" alt=\"img_3204\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertdustingflamenkito070417/img_3205.jpg\" alt=\"img_3205\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d471543